 "description": "Faithful to the Antares range, the Antares 12 Coupe affirms its position as a versatile family cruiser, designed for long-distance sailing in all latitudes. Benefiting from proven expertise and complementing the Antares 12 Fly, it combines comfort, elegance and innovation with a spirit of shared pleasure and serenity.",
