 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "With its unique design and modern shape, the Antares 12 Coupe embodies the aesthetic codes that have been the signature of the range for 45 years. The hull glazing and gunwale create a sleek line, while the protective, streamlined aft roof enhances the overall balance of the boat.\nThe electric starboard platform naturally extends the outdoor living space and simplifies access to the water for paddleboarding or swimming.",
