  {
   "kind": "interior-design",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The Antares 12 Coupe, ideal for family cruises or short trips with friends, is the perfect blend of modularity and space. The spacious, bright and elegant master cabin has its own bathroom, just like the guests, who benefit from a fully equipped cabin. A third modular area can be transformed as needed into an extra bunk or storage space. Combined with the convertible wheelhouse seating area, the Antares 12 Coupe can accommodate up to eight people on board for a wonderful night at anchor off the coast.",
   "items": [],
