  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Outstanding comfort for extended cruises",
   "intro": "Designed to provide outstanding comfort, the Antares 12 Coupe is perfectly suited for long-distance cruising. Much more than just a weekender, this boat offers the ideal conditions for spending several days on board, leisurely and completely serenely",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Luminosity and ease of movement on board",
     "text": "The Antares 12 Coupe series is equipped with a large electric glass roof that floods the living area with natural light. Inside, the glass panes disappear to create a seamless transition between the cockpit and the wheelhouse, ensuring smooth passage between areas."
    },
    {
     "title": "Designed for all horizons",
     "text": "The Antares 12 Coupe is designed to sail in all weather conditions. Its long roof, extended by a canopy, effectively covers the cockpit. A side closure canvas is available as an option to reinforce this protection. For more light and openness, a canvas sunroof can also be integrated into the canopy. Ventilation, shade or shelter from the cold: everything has been designed for your comfort, whatever the latitude."
    },
    {
     "title": "Sophistication down to the finest detail",
     "text": "On board, every detail reflects a keen sense of refinement. The spacious and bright wheelhouse combines generous storage space, a U-shaped saloon and a fully equipped galley. The use of fine materials, the play of light and the meticulous finishes create an elegant atmosphere, ideal for savouring every moment."
    },
    {
     "title": "Technology and performance designed for cruising",
     "text": "The high-performance hull structure, combined with 2x400 or 3x300 hp engines and equipped with a joystick, offers optimum power and manoeuvrability. The optional Seakeeper gyroscopic stabiliser improves sailing comfort in all conditions."
    }
   ],
